Route39_Text_PsychicNormanIntro::
	.string "Let me see what your POKéMON are\n"
	.string "capable of.$"

Route39_Text_PsychicNormanDefeat::
	.string "Ooh, your POKéMON have potential.$"

Route39_Text_PsychicNorman::
	.string "You know how POKéMON have different\n"
	.string "abilities?\p"
	.string "People are like that too. Everyone\n"
	.string "has different potential.$"

Route39_Text_Pokefan154Intro::
	.string "Would you mind if I bragged about\n"
	.string "my POKéMON?$"

Route39_Text_Pokefan154Defeat::
	.string "I couldn’t begin to brag...$"

Route39_Text_Pokefan154::
	.string "I’m not listening to your bragging!\p"
	.string "We POKéFANS have a policy of not\n"
	.string "listening to other people brag!$"

Route39_Text_PokefanRuthIntro::
	.string "Such darling POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Let’s show our POKéMON together\n"
	.string "at the same time.$"

Route39_Text_PokefanRuthDefeat::
	.string "I don’t mind losing.$"

Route39_Text_PokefanRuth::
	.string "Do you know about baby POKéMON?\n"
	.string "I bet they’re just adorable!$"

Route39_Text_SailorEugeneIntro::
	.string "I just got back to OLIVINE.\n"
	.string "So how about a POKéMON battle?$"

Route39_Text_SailorEugeneDefeat::
	.string "Awaaargh!$"

Route39_Text_SailorEugene::
	.string "My POKéMON were caught and raised\n"
	.string "overseas.\p"
	.string "They’re my companions on those long\n"
	.string "voyages.$"

Route39_Text_Slowbro::
	.string "MILTANK: Mooo!$"

